<title>UK: Helaba unit sets 200 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Helaba unit sets 200 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and Salomon.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HELABA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  LANDESBANK HESSEN-THUERINGEN GZ</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.23    PAY DATE   S07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.605    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
